{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Merry Bear",
    "steam_appid": 2738620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/bb377352e00b70ab55d84695f832a7ee.poster.avif?t=1755273631\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/bb377352e00b70ab55d84695f832a7ee.webm?t=1755273631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/bb377352e00b70ab55d84695f832a7ee.mp4?t=1755273631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce on marshmallows across cocoa swamps, slide through popsicle caves, and explore a spooky dollhouse in this charming 2D platformer. Help Merry Bear find her mascot neighbors by jumping, dancing, and prancing through a delightful, hand-drawn world influenced by mid-century illustration and advertising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merry Bear has always dreamed of becoming a theme park mascot, so she moves to the base of Summit Park. When she arrives, however, the neighborhood of mascots is empty and the Summit Park cable car is broken. To solve her dilemma, Merry Bear must travel through themed lands filled with fruit punch waterfalls, figure out how to make espresso, explore the depths of a drive-in cinema, and navigate a giant freezer filled with TV dinners and skating penguins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But just because a lady bear has a job to do it doesn't mean she can't take a minute to furnish her A-frame cabin, find some new outfits, or even fill out her vinyl collection. If all goes well, you might just save the neighborhood and finally reach your dream upon Summit Park's peak!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/727d3861c65174468fc024e4f83e1b2e.avif?t=1755273631\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Openly explore a hand-drawn world filled with heavily themed lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dance with a narwhal, a cow, and almost every creature you come across</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover  furniture, plants, records, and outfits to fill out your new house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solve platforming puzzles and discover new areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Wrap Merry Bear up like a fireproof burrito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ride a submarine and a steamship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Bounce around on a LOT of marshmallows</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/bb377352e00b70ab55d84695f832a7ee.poster.avif?t=1755273631\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/bb377352e00b70ab55d84695f832a7ee.webm?t=1755273631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/bb377352e00b70ab55d84695f832a7ee.mp4?t=1755273631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce on marshmallows across cocoa swamps, slide through popsicle caves, and explore a spooky dollhouse in this charming 2D platformer. Help Merry Bear find her mascot neighbors by jumping, dancing, and prancing through a delightful, hand-drawn world influenced by mid-century illustration and advertising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merry Bear has always dreamed of becoming a theme park mascot, so she moves to the base of Summit Park. When she arrives, however, the neighborhood of mascots is empty and the Summit Park cable car is broken. To solve her dilemma, Merry Bear must travel through themed lands filled with fruit punch waterfalls, figure out how to make espresso, explore the depths of a drive-in cinema, and navigate a giant freezer filled with TV dinners and skating penguins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But just because a lady bear has a job to do it doesn't mean she can't take a minute to furnish her A-frame cabin, find some new outfits, or even fill out her vinyl collection. If all goes well, you might just save the neighborhood and finally reach your dream upon Summit Park's peak!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738620/extras/727d3861c65174468fc024e4f83e1b2e.avif?t=1755273631\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Openly explore a hand-drawn world filled with heavily themed lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dance with a narwhal, a cow, and almost every creature you come across</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover  furniture, plants, records, and outfits to fill out your new house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solve platforming puzzles and discover new areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Wrap Merry Bear up like a fireproof burrito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ride a submarine and a steamship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Bounce around on a LOT of marshmallows</p>",
    "short_description": "A charming 2D platformer where you traverse through themed lands of giant fruit, TV dinners, spooky dollhouses, and your cozy, new A-frame cabin. Help Merry Bear find her mascot neighbors (and maybe some chic furniture) in a delightful, hand-drawn world influenced by mid-century illustration.",
